  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>​​Size &amp; Fit\nStandard fit is athletic and relaxedDesigned to hit comfortably above the knee\n\nProduct Features\nSoft, lightweight fleece construction delivers high-level comfort\nReflective Nike Futura and Air Max branding above the left hem provides high-visibility signature style\nBold, colorblocked side panel creates an asymmetrical, sport-inspired look\nElastic waistband with an adjustable drawcord ensures customized comfort\nHand pockets and an oversized zip pocket on the left provide ample, secure storage for essentials\n100% polyester\nMachine wash\nThe Nike Sportswear Air Max Fleece Shorts are imported.\nHeritage and high-tech style combine with the Men's Nike Sportswear Air Max Fleece Shorts, giving you a pair of everyday shorts with standout style. Designed to echo the aesthetic of the iconic Air Max franchise, these shorts blend breathable, lightweight fleece with technical details for street style and endless versatility. The asymmetrical color-blocking and reflective branding pay homage to the legendary sneaker line while the secure zip-storage keeps you prepared for everything on your agenda.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Sportswear Air Max Fleece Shorts</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Black/White</